jvi (just vi) is a 1200 loc vi implementation. 
	note:
		The only way to return from insert state to normal state is by using Ctrl+c
		jvi 1.0 is only 900 loc and does not have selection mode, available at https://github.com/KrzysztofMarciniak/jvi/archive/refs/tags/1.0.tar.gz
	compilation:
		cc -std=c89 -O2 -o jvi main.c
	installation:
		install -m 755 jvi /usr/local/bin/jvi
		OR
		install -m 755 jvi /usr/local/bin/vi
